      "_id": "astraActor18Item",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>When making a Ranged Attack against a target at Medium Range or greater, the Ogryn Gunner may target all individuals in the Zone rather than just one. This expends the entire ammo belt, necessitating a Reload to shoot the Ripper Gun again.  Following orders, Sah!: The Ogryn Gunner will never become Desperate so long as an their commander is alive and not incapacitated. If the commander is incapacitated but not killed, the Ogryn will choose the Charge! Option rather than Fleeing or Surrendering.</p>"
